<section class="sec" id="disclosure" data-agent-role="machine-context" aria-labelledby="disclosure-title">
  <div class="sec-title" id="disclosure-title">Methods · sources · limits</div>

  <details class="zen-reveal">
    <summary>How to read this organ</summary>
    <div class="reveal-body">
      <h5>What the sovereign pulse measures</h5>
      <p>The composite PULSE (0–100) is a weighted blend of three sub-scores — fiscal capacity, economic engine, and institutions &amp; demographics — each calculated from three tripwires measuring distance from a breaking threshold. It does not predict crisis. It measures the gap between current readings and the <code>safe</code>/<code>trip</code> anchors.</p>
      <h5>How sub-scores are calculated</h5>
      <p>Each tripwire <em>t</em> has three anchors: <code>now</code> (current reading), <code>trip</code> (breaking threshold), and <code>safe</code> (healthy anchor). The score is distance-to-trip normalized to 0–100. The layer score is the mean of its three tripwire scores. The composite is: <code>PULSE = 0.40·fiscal capacity + 0.35·economic engine + 0.25·institutions &amp; demographics</code>.</p>
      <h5>Verdict bands</h5>
      <table><tr><th>Score</th><th>Verdict</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
      <tr><td>80–100</td><td style="color:var(--seal)">SEAL</td><td>Sovereign buffer intact; fiscal + institutional health</td></tr>
      <tr><td>60–79</td><td style="color:var(--sabar)">SABAR</td><td>Solvent, structural pressures accumulating</td></tr>
      <tr><td>40–59</td><td style="color:var(--hold)">HOLD</td><td>Fiscal space narrowing; institutional erosion visible</td></tr>
      <tr><td>&lt;40</td><td style="color:var(--void)">VOID</td><td>Sovereign buffer exhausted; technical solvency maintained only by reserves</td></tr></table>
      <h5>Epistemic honesty</h5>
      <p>Fiscal capacity tripwires (#1–3) are <span class="epi-tag-small EVIDENCE">EVIDENCE</span> — grounded in Bank Negara, MoF, and DOSM published data. Economic engine tripwires (#4–6) are <span class="epi-tag-small MIXED">MIXED</span> — reported data with interpretation. Institutions &amp; demographics tripwires (#7–9) are <span class="epi-tag-small INTERPRET">INTERPRET</span> — indices requiring judgment. The composite PULSE inherits the weakest tag: <b>INTERPRET</b>.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

